o's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"VVH6k9-ycttH3TV_lk5WfQ","review_id":"u6Aoorrw34oRIYehKdvH1Q","date":"2013-06-09T17:43:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9590340256690979,"text_excerpt":"Fried chicken fan? This is the place. Yes, like the others describe, the neighborhood is not the French Quarter, and I would not feel 100% safe going at night, without a car, but the chicken is amazing. Not only do you get the golden brown, crunchy exterior, but there's a second, buttery soft layer underneath, giving the chicken an extra bit of juicy goodness. This place gets packed quickly, so even at 2PM we had a 20 minute wait. That's ok, because it just let you bask in the smell of chicken heaven. Our waitress was fast and friendly, service was top notch. My only beef (pun intended), was they ran out of Mac and cheese before we got to it, so I had the butter beans per her recommendati..."},{"business_id":"VVH6k9-ycttH3TV_lk5WfQ","review_id":"cdd6hQNQO9oDCcSrZzg34g","date":"2020-03-27T20:52:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9541817903518677,"text_excerpt":"I've probably had some of the best fried chicken in my life here. Wow!! We went on a Monday at like 11:30 am, but there was still a long line - that's how impressive this place is. I like that it's kind of located away from the touristy parts of New Orleans. There was ample parking around as well. This place has such a home-y vibe when you walk in. There's a decent amount of seating and the service is great! We ordered fried chicken (obviously) and a bunch of sides including fried okra and mac n cheese. Everything came out to perfection. I would definitely recommend to anyone looking for some really solid, authentic fried chicken."},{"business_id":"VVH6k9-ycttH3TV_lk5WfQ","review_id":"e27jd0MTXad-yP6SC6dKTw","date":"2014-12-17T18:46:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9538623690605164,"text_excerpt":"THIS IS THE FRIED CHICKEN THAT GOD WOULD EAT. Seriously. So good. I was there on a Monday for a late breakfast/early lunch and there wasn't any wait. Since Willie Mae's won the James Beard \"American Classic\" award for their outstanding fried chicken and has been featured on numerous food/travel shows, this was definitely an anomaly as the place can get packed pretty darn quick on weekends or peak hours (at least according to other reviews). If you can come in at or before 11, you should be able to avoid the long lines. I was pretty happy with myself as a food tourist for choosing to come when I did. The place is a somewhat unimpressive when you first get there and if you simply happened u..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"VVH6k9-ycttH3TV_lk5WfQ","photo_id":"4oVv_TTlof7SiKgPegmVBw","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/4oVv_TTlof7SiKgPegmVBw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8177783489227295},{"business_id":"VVH6k9-ycttH3TV_lk5WfQ","photo_id":"Vs87RbTrTRf7p0rlQXtDzQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Vs87RbTrTRf7p0rlQXtDzQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.808402419090271},{"business_id":"VVH6k9-ycttH3TV_lk5WfQ","photo_id":"KlsbuqRQqHqlDG-I9CifOA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/KlsbuqRQqHqlDG-I9CifOA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7909170985221863},{"business_id":"VVH6k9-ycttH3TV_lk5WfQ","photo_id":"z1yiIHW4zsgAH5z6jY2nvw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/z1yiIHW4zsgAH5z6jY2nvw.jpg","visual_representativeness